{
  "schema": "elastic_plateau_registry.v3",
  "principle": "Every major narrative stage is an elastic plateau. Authored beats advance the campaign; elastic beats let players wander, train, recover, loop, deepen, or stagnate without invalidating narrative truth.",
  "global_constraints": [
    "Yin and Yang may appear as present companions only before the scripted loss.",
    "After SCRIPTED_DEFEAT, Yin and Yang may appear only as absent, echo, memory, background motif, star, or final symbolic light until future sequel content explicitly changes this rule.",
    "The Siren of Masks is an early antagonist and cannot become the final boss.",
    "The Hollow Reflection is the final release boss.",
    "Elastic content cannot set major story flags unless its contract category is AUTHORED_CRITICAL or AUTHORED_MILESTONE.",
    "Every generated socket is a traversal contract: terrain, collision, camera, spawn, and validation must prove access."
